' Shishoza — UPDATED Use Case Diagram (adds citizen accounts + review workflow + email)
' Render at https://www.plantuml.com/plantuml  or the VS Code PlantUML extension.
@startuml Shishoza_UseCase
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam actorStyle awesome

actor "Citizen\n(optional account)" as C
actor "Forest Manager" as M
actor "Email Service" as E <<external>>

rectangle "Shishoza System" {
  usecase "Register / Sign in"                     as UC0
  usecase "Enter parcel (upload cert / GPS / draw)" as UC1
  usecase "Extract cadastral location"             as UC2
  usecase "View satellite tree-cover & risk"       as UC3
  usecase "Simulate a cut"                         as UC4
  usecase "View reason & alternatives"             as UC5
  usecase "Submit parcel for manager review"       as UC6
  usecase "Track my review requests (My Reviews)"  as UC7
  usecase "View district HIGH-risk dashboard"      as UC8
  usecase "Review requests (approve / reject + note)" as UC9
  usecase "Filter requests by district & status"   as UC10
  usecase "Notify citizen of decision"             as UC11
}

C --> UC0
C --> UC1
C --> UC3
C --> UC4
C --> UC6
C --> UC7

M --|> C : inherits citizen use cases
M --> UC8
M --> UC9
M --> UC10

UC1 ..> UC2  : <<include>>
UC4 ..> UC5  : <<extend>> (risk HIGH/MED)
UC6 ..> UC3  : <<include>>
UC9 ..> UC11 : <<include>>
UC11 --> E   : sends email

note bottom of E
  NEW vs report: Citizen is no longer anonymous;
  +Register/Sign in, +Submit for review, +My Reviews,
  +Manager review/decision, +Email service actor.
  Was "10 use cases, 2 actors" -> 12 use cases, 2 human + 1 external actor.
end note
@enduml
